<title>GERMANY: Rheinmetall shares suspended from trade.</title>
<headline>Rheinmetall shares suspended from trade.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German engineering company Rheinmetall AG were suspended from trade on Thursday, the Duesseldorf bourse said. It did not give a reason for the suspension.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
